<title>USA: Analysis &amp; Technology wins contract.</title>
<headline>Analysis &amp; Technology wins contract.</headline>
<dateline>NORTH STONINGTON, Conn. 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Analysis &amp; Technology Inc said on Thursday that it received a contract from the Naval Undersea Warfare Center Systems Division based in Newport, Rhode Island. valued at $11.4 million over a five-year period.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Analysis &amp; Technology would provide test and evaluation services for surface ship combat systems.</p>
<p>(( --New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
